<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
    <title><%= title %></title>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-white font-sans text-muni-ink antialiased">
    <%- include('partials/navigation') %>

    <main id="contenido-principal" class="flex flex-1 items-center px-4 py-12 md:px-7 md:py-16">
        <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[780px] rounded-3xl border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_24px_80px_-48px_rgba(25,25,25,0.25)] sm:p-10 lg:p-12" aria-labelledby="register-heading">
            <nav class="mb-7 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-muni-muted" aria-label="Ruta de navegación">
                <a href="/" class="hover:text-muni-red-dark">Inicio</a>
                <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
                <a href="<%= next && next !== '/' ? `/login?next=${encodeURIComponent(next)}` : '/login' %>" class="hover:text-muni-red-dark">Acceso vecinal</a>
                <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
                <span aria-current="page" class="text-muni-ink">Crear cuenta vecinal</span>
            </nav>
            <h1 id="register-heading" class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-4xl">Únete a Muni Sport.</h1>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-muni-muted">Regístrate como vecina o vecino para guardar talleres e inscribirte en actividades deportivas de Talca. Enviaremos un código de verificación de 4 dígitos a tu correo para confirmar que te pertenece.</p>

            <% if (errors && errors.length) { %>
                <div class="mt-6 border-y border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-4 py-4 text-sm leading-6 text-red-900" role="alert">
                    <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-1"><% errors.forEach((message) => { %><li><%= message %></li><% }) %></ul>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <form action="/register" method="post" class="mt-7 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-5 sm:grid-cols-2" novalidate>
                <input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
                <input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%= next || '/' %>">

                <div>
                    <label for="rut" class="form-label">RUT</label>
                    <input id="rut" name="rut" type="text" class="form-control" value="<%= values.rut || '' %>" placeholder="12.345.678-5" maxlength="12" required autocomplete="off" autofocus>
                    <p class="form-hint">Ingresa tu RUT con dígito verificador.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="primerNombre" class="form-label">Primer nombre</label>
                    <input id="primerNombre" name="primerNombre" type="text" class="form-control" value="<%= values.primerNombre || '' %>" placeholder="Ej. Camila" minlength="1" maxlength="60" required autocomplete="given-name">
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="apellidoPaterno" class="form-label">Apellido paterno</label>
                    <input id="apellidoPaterno" name="apellidoPaterno" type="text" class="form-control" value="<%= values.apellidoPaterno || '' %>" placeholder="Ej. González" minlength="1" maxlength="60" required autocomplete="family-name">
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="apellidoMaterno" class="form-label">Apellido materno</label>
                    <input id="apellidoMaterno" name="apellidoMaterno" type="text" class="form-control" value="<%= values.apellidoMaterno || '' %>" placeholder="Ej. Rojas" minlength="1" maxlength="60" required autocomplete="additional-name">
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="telefono" class="form-label">Número de teléfono</label>
                    <input id="telefono" name="telefono" type="tel" inputmode="numeric" pattern="9[0-9]{8}" maxlength="9" class="form-control" value="<%= values.telefono || '' %>" placeholder="912345678" required autocomplete="tel-national">
                    <p class="form-hint">Debe ser un numero valido.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="email" class="form-label">Correo electrónico</label>
                    <input id="email" name="email" type="email" class="form-control" value="<%= values.email || '' %>" placeholder="tu@correo.cl" maxlength="254" required autocomplete="email">
                    <p class="form-hint">Recibirás aquí un código de 4 dígitos.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="password" class="form-label">Contraseña</label>
                    <input id="password" name="password" type="password" class="form-control" placeholder="Mínimo 8 caracteres" minlength="8" maxlength="72" required autocomplete="new-password">
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="passwordConfirmation" class="form-label">Repite la contraseña</label>
                    <input id="passwordConfirmation" name="passwordConfirmation" type="password" class="form-control" placeholder="Vuelve a escribirla" minlength="8" maxlength="72" required autocomplete="new-password">
                </div>

                <div class="sm:col-span-2">
                    <span class="form-label">Ícono de perfil <span class="font-normal text-muni-muted">(opcional)</span></span>
                    <% const avatarSeleccionado = values.avatarUrl || ''; %>
                    <div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-5" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Selecciona un ícono de perfil">
                        <label class="group cursor-pointer">
                            <input type="radio" name="avatarUrl" value="" class="peer sr-only" <%= !avatarSeleccionado ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                            <span class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-muni-soft/50 p-2.5 text-center transition-all hover:border-muni-red/50 hover:bg-white peer-checked:border-muni-red-dark peer-checked:bg-red-50/70 peer-checked:ring-2 peer-checked:ring-muni-red-dark peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-muni-ink">
                                <span class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-muni-soft text-sm font-semibold text-muni-red-dark ring-1 ring-black/10">AB</span>
                                <span class="text-xs font-medium text-muni-ink">Iniciales</span>
                            </span>
                        </label>
                        <% (avataresDisponibles || []).forEach((avatar) => { %>
                            <label class="group cursor-pointer">
                                <input type="radio" name="avatarUrl" value="<%= avatar.url %>" class="peer sr-only" <%= avatarSeleccionado === avatar.url ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                                <span class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-muni-soft/50 p-2.5 text-center transition-all hover:border-muni-red/50 hover:bg-white peer-checked:border-muni-red-dark peer-checked:bg-red-50/70 peer-checked:ring-2 peer-checked:ring-muni-red-dark peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-muni-ink">
                                    <img src="<%= avatar.url %>" alt="<%= avatar.nombre %>" class="h-14 w-14 rounded-xl object-cover shadow-sm transition-transform group-hover:scale-105" width="56" height="56">
                                    <span class="text-xs font-medium text-muni-ink"><%= avatar.nombre %></span>
                                </span>
                            </label>
                        <% }) %>
                    </div>
                    <p class="form-hint">Elige un ícono para tu perfil o deja tus iniciales por defecto.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="sm:col-span-2">
                    <button type="submit" class="inline-flex min-h-12 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-muni-red-dark px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-red-800">Enviar código de verificación</button>
                </div>
            </form>

            <p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-muni-muted">¿Ya tienes cuenta? <a href="<%= next && next !== '/' ? `/login?next=${encodeURIComponent(next)}` : '/login' %>" class="font-semibold text-muni-ink underline decoration-muni-red underline-offset-4 hover:text-muni-red-dark">Iniciar sesión</a></p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
